225 582 1873 (lists the drive characteristics of the disk named by d: that is in the range A:, B:,...,P:. The drive) 1873 SB
225 641 970 (characteristics are listed in the following format: ) 970 SB
225 760 586 (         d: Drive Characteristics) 586 SB
