525 345 1447 (System is copied to memory. SYSGEN then prompts with the following:) 1447 SB
225 464 659 (DESTINATION DRIVE NAME) 659 SB
225 523 609 (\(OR RETURN TO REBOOT\)) 609 SB
525 641 1582 (If a disk is being initialized, place the new disk into a drive and answer with the ) 1582 SB
