225 2357 1909 (The DUMP program types the contents of the disk file \(ufn\) at the console in hexadecimal form.) 1909 SB
225 2416 1921 (The file contents are listed sixteen bytes at a time, with the absolute byte address listed to the left) 1921 SB
225 2475 1830 (of each line in hexadecimal. Long typeouts can be aborted by pressing the rubout key during) 1830 SB
225 2535 1797 (printout. The source listing of the DUMP program is given in Section 5 as an example of a) 1797 SB
