225 1884 1795 (There are three error situations that the Basic Disk Operating System intercepts during file) 1795 SB
225 1943 1688 (processing. When one of these conditions is detected, the BDOS prints the message: ) 1688 SB
225 2061 492 (BDOS ERR ON d: error) 492 SB
225 2180 1398 (where d is the drive name and error is one of the three error messages:) 1398 SB
225 2298 309 (BAD SECTOR) 309 SB
