225 700 1950 (with the following action applied n times to the memory buffer: search from the current CP for the) 1950 SB
225 760 1915 (next occurrence of the string S1. If found, insert the string S2, and move CP to follow S2.  Then) 1915 SB
225 819 1930 (delete all characters following CP up to, but not including, the string S3, leaving CP directly after) 1930 SB
225 878 1432 (S2. If S3 cannot be found, then no deletion is made. If the current line is) 1432 SB
