225 1174 1656 (constant, is denoted by a trailing radix indicator. The following are radix indicators:) 1656 SB
225 1292 98 (     B) 98 SB
375 1292 566 (is a binary constant \(base 2\).) 566 SB
225 1351 101 (     O) 101 SB
375 1351 541 (is a octal constant \(base 8\).) 541 SB
