225 227 1859 (Following the sign-on message, DDT prompts you with the hyphen character, -, and waits for) 1859 SB
225 286 1812 (input commands from the console.  You can type any of several singlecharacter commands,) 1812 SB
225 345 1928 (followed by a carriage return to execute the command. Each line of input can be line-edited using) 1928 SB
225 405 764 (the following standard CP/M controls:) 764 SB
225 464 13 ( ) 13 SB
873 523 655 (Table 4-1.  Line-editing Controls) 655 SB
225 641 65 (     ) 65 SB
