225 760 301 (     rubout        ) 301 SB
675 760 641 (removes the last character typed) 641 SB
225 878 362 (     CTRL-U         ) 362 SB
675 878 831 (removes the entire line, ready for retyping) 831 SB
225 996 359 (     CTRL-C         ) 359 SB
675 996 297 (reboots system) 297 SB
225 1115 1873 (Any command can be up to 32 characters in length. An automatic carriage return is inserted as) 1873 SB
225 1174 1888 (character 33, where the first character determines the command type. Table 4-2 describes DDT) 1888 SB
225 1233 225 (commands.) 225 SB
