225 1647 1263 (     A         enters assembly-language mnemonics with operands.) 1263 SB
225 1765 1096 (     D         displays memory in hexadecimal and ASCII.) 1096 SB
225 1884 844 (     F         fills memory with constant data.) 844 SB
225 2002 1081 (     G         begins execution with optional breakpoints.) 1081 SB
