225 2120 1824 (The organization of DDT allows certain nonessential portions to be overlaid to gain a larger) 1824 SB
225 2180 1890 (transient program area for debugging large programs. The DDT program consists of two parts:) 1890 SB
225 2239 1887 (the DDT nucleus and the assembler/disassembler module.  The DDT nucleus is loaded over the) 1887 SB
225 2298 1949 (CCP and, although loaded with the DDT nucleus, the assembler/disassembler is overlayable unless) 1949 SB
225 2357 650 (used to assemble or disassemble.) 650 SB
