225 937 1873 (The Console Input function reads the next console character to register A. Graphic characters,) 1873 SB
225 996 1900 (along with carriage return, line-feed, and back space \(CTRL-H\) are echoed to the console.  Tab) 1900 SB
225 1055 1892 (characters, CTRL-I, move the cursor to the next tab stop. A check is made for start/stop scroll,) 1892 SB
225 1115 1930 (CTRL-S, and start/stop printer echo, CTRL-P. The FDOS does not return to the calling program) 1930 SB
