225 1706 90 (     2) 90 SB
525 1706 1591 (batch mode: use the READER as the CONSOLE input, and the LIST device as ) 1591 SB
525 1765 608 (the CONSOLE output \(BAT:\)) 608 SB
225 1825 90 (     3) 90 SB
525 1825 696 (user-defined console device \(UCI:\)) 696 SB
