225 2120 195 (               ) 195 SB
675 2120 197 (location 3) 197 SB
1125 2120 1011 (Set initial value of IOBYTE, if implemented in the ) 1011 SB
1125 2180 147 (CBIOS) 147 SB
225 2298 195 (               ) 195 SB
675 2298 197 (location 4) 197 SB
1125 2298 982 (High nibble = current user no; low nibble current ) 982 SB
1125 2357 100 (drive) 100 SB
