225 1884 1789 (the value 0000H if no sector translation takes place \(that is, the physical and logical sector) 1789 SB
225 1943 1858 (numbers are the same\). Disk drives with identical sector skew factors share the same translate) 1858 SB
225 2002 127 (tables.) 127 SB
225 2120 165 (     0000) 165 SB
675 2120 1443 (Scratch pad values for use within the BDOS, initial value is unimportant.) 1443 SB
