225 760 180 (   -EXM ) 180 SB
525 760 1637 (is the extent mask, determined by the data block allocation size and the number of ) 1637 SB
525 819 235 (disk blocks.) 235 SB
225 937 177 (   -DSM ) 177 SB
525 937 1075 (determines the total storage capacity of the disk drive.) 1075 SB
225 1055 182 (   -DRM ) 182 SB
525 1055 1595 (determines the total number of directory entries that can be stored on this drive. ) 1595 SB
225 1174 275 (   -AL0, AL1 ) 275 SB
525 1174 723 (determine reserved directory blocks.) 723 SB
225 1233 13 ( ) 13 SB
225 1292 165 (   -CKS ) 165 SB
525 1292 793 (is the size of the directory check vector.) 793 SB
225 1351 13 ( ) 13 SB
225 1410 159 (   -OFF ) 159 SB
525 1410 1377 (is the number of reserved tracks at the beginning of the \(logical\) disk.) 1377 SB
