225 286 1409 (parameter values. The last example produces a full 8-megabyte system.) 1409 SB
525 405 777 (DISKDEF 0,1,58,,2048,256,128,128,2) 777 SB
375 464 1100 (r=4096, k=512, d=128, c=128, e=256, b=16, s=58, t=2) 1100 SB
525 582 752 (DISKDEF 0,1,58,,2048,1024,300,0,2) 752 SB
